Title: Authorization Code flow - Client app registration

participant Client's Developer
participant Authorization Server
participant Client

Note right of Client: A web/mobile app
Client's Developer->Authorization Server: Register client app
Note right of Client's Developer: GET /o/applications/register/
Authorization Server-->Client's Developer: Registration form
Note left of Authorization Server: Form contains client id & secret (unencrypted)
Client's Developer->Client: Store client id &  secret (unencrypted)
Note right of Client's Developer: Store client secret ONLY IF\nclient type is confidential
Client's Developer->Authorization Server: Submit form
Note right of Client's Developer: Form data:\nclient_type: confidential\ngrant_type: authorization_code\nredirect_uri: <callback_url>
Authorization Server-->Client's Developer: App registered
